    "subtitle": "Series 2: Episode 1",
    "synopses": {
     "large": "Claudia Winkleman welcomes a brand new group of celebrities as they arrive at a beautiful castle in the Scottish Highlands to play the ultimate reality game of detection, back-stabbing and trust.\n\nIt’s not long before the famous faces are questioning everything - and everyone - as Claudia secretly assigns the Traitors. Their task is simple: under the cover of darkness, they must pick off their fellow players one by one, murdering them from the game. The others - the Faithful - must try to uncover the Traitors and banish them before becoming their next victim. The players who survive will face each other in the final, hoping to win up to £100,000 for their chosen charity. If a Traitor remains, they take all the money and leave victorious.",
     "small": "Claudia Winkleman welcomes a brand new group of celebrities to the Scottish Highlands.",
     "medium": "Claudia Winkleman welcomes a brand new group of celebrities as they arrive at a beautiful castle in the Scottish Highlands to play the ultimate reality game of detection, back-stabbing and trust.",
     "preview": "Claudia welcomes twenty-one new famous faces to the ultimate game of deception. Who will be a Traitor, who will be Faithful, and who will make it to the end game?",
     "editorial": "They’re famous, they’re fabulous... they have no idea. Let the mind games begin!",
     "programme_small": "An all-star cast are ready to play the ultimate game of deceit and betrayal."
    },
